      <p begin="02:18.410" end="02:20.190" ttm:agent="v1">I'm a mother****erg Starboy</p>
      <p begin="02:20.190" end="02:21.690" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:20.870" end="02:22.370" ttm:agent="v1">Let a nigga Brag Pitt</p>
      <p begin="02:22.130" end="02:24.680" ttm:agent="v1">Legend of the fall took the year like a bandit</p>
      <p begin="02:24.680" end="02:27.240" ttm:agent="v1">Bought mama a crib and a brand new wagon</p>
      <p begin="02:27.240" end="02:29.850" ttm:agent="v1">Now she hit the grocery shop looking lavish</p>
      <p begin="02:29.850" end="02:32.470" ttm:agent="v1">Star Trek roof in that Wraith of Khan</p>
      <p begin="02:32.470" end="02:34.980" ttm:agent="v1">Girls get loose when they hear this song</p>
      <p begin="02:34.980" end="02:37.200" ttm:agent="v1">100 on the dash get me close to God</p>
      <p begin="02:37.200" end="02:39.590" ttm:agent="v1">We don't pray for love, we just pray for cars</p>
      <p begin="02:39.590" end="02:41.140" ttm:agent="v1"/>
